# AgriKisan — Agricultural Store POS & Inventory Management System

AgriKisan is a comprehensive, multi-tenant Point of Sale (POS), Inventory, and Ledger Management 
web application built specifically for agricultural input distributors, fertilizer stores, and seed merchants. 
It streamlines daily retail billing, GST calculations, stock batch tracking, customer credit dues, and distributor subscription verification.

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

## Key Features

* ⚡ Fast POS & Billing:** Quick action shortcuts (`F1` to `F11`) for counter sales, purchases, payments, receipts, and expense logging[cite: 17].
* 📦 Inventory & Batch Management:** Track material batches, MRP, purchase rates, expiry dates, and automated low-stock threshold alerts.
* 👥 Customer & Supplier Ledgers:** Maintain customer credit limits, crop profiles, irrigation details, outstanding balances, and auto-updating account ledgers.
* 💳 UPI Subscription & Approval Workflow:** Built-in subscription gating with UPI QR scanning, UTR reference submission[cite: 16], and distributor admin activation.
* 📊 Financial Reports & History:** Real-time summary metrics for daily sales, purchases, expenses, and date-wise ledger transaction histories.

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

## Tech Stack

* Backend: Python, Flask, Psycopg2 (PostgreSQL adapter)
* Database: PostgreSQL (with Row/User data-scoping constraints)
* Frontend: HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript (Responsive POS layout)
* Security: Werkzeug password hashing, Flask session management, role & subscription middleware

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

